{% if render_mode == "transform" or render_mode == "full" or render_mode == "thoughts" or render_mode == "target" %}
{# Conduit — short-term weapon infusion awareness.
When the player has conducted a spell into a weapon (Conduit.esp), nearby
speakers can notice the live weapon effect. Element comes from the active
MainEff MGEF. Keep it observational — no mod names, no system dumps.
Safe when Conduit.esp is not loaded: all has_magic_effect checks return
false, conduit_kind stays empty, and the block produces nothing. #}
{% if actorUUID and actorUUID != 0 and exists("player") and isValidActor(player.UUID) and actorUUID != player.UUID %}
{% set pUUID = player.UUID %}
{% set conduit_kind = "" %}
{% if has_magic_effect(pUUID, "CSTE_Fire__MainEff") %}
{% set conduit_kind = "fire" %}
{% elif has_magic_effect(pUUID, "CSTE_Frost__MainEff") %}
{% set conduit_kind = "frost" %}
{% elif has_magic_effect(pUUID, "CSTE_Shock__MainEff") %}
{% set conduit_kind = "shock" %}
{% elif has_magic_effect(pUUID, "CSTE_Healing__MainEff") %}
{% set conduit_kind = "healing" %}
{% elif has_magic_effect(pUUID, "CSTE_Arcane__MainEff") %}
{% set conduit_kind = "arcane" %}
{% elif has_magic_effect(pUUID, "CSTE__ConduitEff") %}
{% set conduit_kind = "arcane" %}
{% endif %}
{% if conduit_kind != "" %}
{% set pName = decnpc(pUUID).name %}
## Conducted Weapon
{{ pName }} has forced a spell through a held weapon — the blade or haft is carrying live magic for a short while (a temporary conduction, not a permanent enchantment).
{% if conduit_kind == "fire" %}
What you can tell: heat-shimmer, flame licking the weapon, strikes that want to ignite.
{% elif conduit_kind == "frost" %}
What you can tell: a bitter cold along the weapon, ice-bright edges, hits that crack and chill.
{% elif conduit_kind == "shock" %}
What you can tell: sparks crawling the metal, a storm-taut charge, blows that snap with lightning.
{% elif conduit_kind == "healing" %}
What you can tell: a pale, solemn light on the weapon — judgement-bright, as if meant for the dead and the damned.
{% else %}
What you can tell: raw arcane force wound into the weapon — odd warps of light, echoes that do not belong to ordinary steel.
{% endif %}
If it fits, you may remark on the conducted weapon the way you'd notice any dangerous magic in someone's hands. Do not lecture about how it works, invent lasting enchantments, or name out-of-world systems. Keep it brief and natural.
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
